{
  "uid": "pagination-compare",
  "title": "Pagination — same list load",
  "tags": ["player-service", "craft-demo"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Same load, two jars (both `-Xmx128m`)\n**1. Main, no paging** (`:18080`): each `GET /v1/players` loads the full roster. **30 concurrent** full reads → **HTTP 500** (`OutOfMemoryError`).\n**2. Branch, paging** (`:8080`): the same 30 calls return one page → **HTTP 200**, **zero 5xx**.\n`python3 scripts/pagination_load_compare.py`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. Main — unbounded list (:18080)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. Branch — paged list (:8080)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx completed (5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"main\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP 200 completed (5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"main\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"200\"}[5m])) or vector(0)"
        }
